  "details": "I would like to have the ability to see where my favorite avatars are from such as being able to see the author. There have been so many times that I have wanted to go back the world where I found my favorited avatars but I can't on my own because all I am able to see on my own is just avatar info with no author or world disclosed anywhere. To remedy this I always have to change into that avatar and ask other players to look click on me. Then they look at the author info to  and tell me what world its from or at least the author of it. \nIn simple words, just add \"show author\" to avatar info or add an additional button above info titled author. It'd be a simple to apply; I mean I can click on other players and see their avatars author but I can't check my own favorite avatars author? Its tedious to have to ask someone to clone my favorited avatar or ask them to tell me me the world/author.",
